      "reading_order": 6,
      "text": "1. The correct electronic configuration is 2, 8, 18\nand 1.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_006",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 234.0,
        "y1": 825.0,
