        "y2": 1181.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9357650876045227,
      "reading_order": 7,
      "text": "2. The given configuration is $a, 4a, (6a + 1)$, and\n$(a - 1)$.\n\nSince $a = 2$, the electronic configuration is 2, 8,\n13, and 1.\n\nThis is the electronic configuration of chromium.\nHence, the correct option is (b)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_007",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 238.0,
        "y1": 1204.0,
        "x2": 1172.0,
        "y2": 1438.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9267535209655762,
      "reading_order": 8,
      "text": "3. Discovery of radioactivity proves the existence\nof subatomic particles. Therefore, it can be con-\ncluded that atoms are divisible.\n\nHence, the correct option is (b)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_008",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 234.0,
        "y1": 1463.0,
        "x2": 1165.0,
        "y2": 1996.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.8961950540542603,
      "reading_order": 9,
      "text": "4. Given that $Z_x:Z_y = 1:7$\n\n$$ r_3 = \\frac{0.529 \\times n^2}{Z_x} $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow 1.587 = \\frac{0.529 \\times 9}{Z_x} $$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow Z_x = 3 $$\n\n$\\therefore$ Atomic number of Y is 21.\n\n$\\therefore$ Electronic configuration of Y is 2, 8, 9 and 2.\n\nHence, the correct option is (b)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_009",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 238.0,
        "y1": 2015.0,
        "x2": 1172.0,
        "y2": 2318.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.8800139427185059,
      "reading_order": 10,
      "text": "5. Electronic configuration of X is 2, 8, 18 and 8.\nElectronic configuration of A is 2, 8, 18, 8 and 2.\n$\\therefore$ No. of electrons in the antepenultimate shell\n$= 18$\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_010",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 239.0,
        "y1": 2334.0,
        "x2": 1172.0,
        "y2": 2567.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.8785991072654724,
      "reading_order": 11,
      "text": "6. According to Rutherford’s atomic model, elec-\ntrons revolve around the nucleus with high\nvelocities.\n\nHence, the correct option is (d)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_011",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 238.0,
        "y1": 2587.0,
        "x2": 1173.0,
        "y2": 2814.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9163082838058472,
      "reading_order": 12,
      "text": "7. In $\\alpha$-ray scattering experiment, $\\alpha$-rays are used\nbecause they are positively charged particles\nand have mass.\nHence, the correct option is (d)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_012",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 1282.0,
        "y1": 626.0,
        "x2": 2077.0,
        "y2": 1002.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9006653428077698,
      "reading_order": 13,
      "text": "8. $\\frac{3A+2(A+x)}{5}=A+0.8$\n\n$\\therefore 5A + 2x = 5A + 4$\n$\\therefore 2x = 4 \\quad \\therefore x = 2$\n\n$\\therefore$ The mass of heavier isotope is $A + 2$.\nHence, the correct option is (b)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_013",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 1280.0,
        "y1": 1028.0,
        "x2": 2049.0,
        "y2": 1419.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.87638920545578,
      "reading_order": 14,
      "text": "9. $-13.6 = \\frac{-13.6 \\times Z^2}{9}$\n$\\therefore Z = 3$\n$\\therefore r_3 = \\frac{0.529 \\times 3^2}{Z} = \\frac{0.529 \\times 3^2}{3} = 0.529 \\times 3$\n$= 1.587 \\text{ A}$\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260312_d1987a26-7899-4263-b724-626f89cbd9ee_7_block_014",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 1258.0,
